    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="01f6c1ff-fe03-53b9-b866-c4616b40e9b3" activityNameId="458ea77b-64de-5aa1-9f39-d7aea7f817d2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Anaerobic digestion plant, biowaste</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Anaerobic digestion plant, biowaste
Infrastructure expenditures are recorded for a plant with a yearly capacity of 10'000t and a lifetime of 25 years.  For stationary machines a lifetime of 10 years is assumed. As a first approximation, the machines are taken into account as cast iron.;
UUID: 9834255e-0fa6-35ff-9aed-1d717618c458
Infrastructure for the pre-treatment process, digestion of bio-waste and the succsesive treatment of the fermented material (de-watering and post composting).
Location: Data represents a Swiss plant.
Technology: Thermophile, single stage digestion with post composting.
Time period: Data is obtained from a recent LCA study.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9834255e-0fa6-35ff-9aed-1d717618c458.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
